alfe-template-option (closed 2026-10-26, alfe 2.3.68) left:

1. =--template default=: the product's own default template -- AutoCAD's
   QNEW template, else acad.dwt / acadiso.dwt by MEASUREINIT; BricsCAD's
   BASEFILE. Needs reading those settings (registry on Windows, the
   product's preferences on macOS) without a running CAD.
2. The macOS run: verify:alfe-template has a Windows job only; BricsCAD V26
   on thalassa (Default-imperial / Default-m under ~/Library/Application
   Support/Bricsys) was not checked -- thalassa could not resolve
   gitlab.com on 2026-10-26.
